      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this should extend to a general world-based panic system. Perhaps a key combination that sends you to a simple world where you can go wherever from there. It would also solve the issue of if the world causes visibility problems to the point the menu cannot be used.\n\nI just don't think such a feature should be limited to CL since having the ability to quickly and silently bail out of a world has other uses too.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
